      "controls": {},
      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Tile wraps the whole frame onto one rectangle of its input, so a single star repeats forever. Slide at 0.5 shifts every other row half a tile, the way bricks are laid, and the Master Gear walks Offset X one tile a loop. Turn Span for more tiles, or put a Repeater in its place for a grid of copies with gaps between them."
        }
      },
